      "role": "user",
      "content": "i checked the netting and it looks fine, no gaps at all. and i haven't seen any cutworms or aphids when i look closely. it's just so weird... it's like they're invisible or just appear out of nowhere. it's almost creepy how they get in and out without leaving a trace of how they actually traveled. is there anything else that could cause that kind of \"vanishing\" damage?",
